pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: sec-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 32, 44, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: 思源宋体
      bold: true
      text: "02"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 34, 700, 30]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      text: 数据集与预处理
  - elementId: head-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 76, 840, 1.5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  # 左：样例拼图
  - elementId: samples-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [60, 118, 540, 144]
    src: media/dataset_samples.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: samples-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 270, 540, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 图 1　四个类别的 MRI 样例（T1 增强，轴位 / 冠状位混合）
  - elementId: preproc-heading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 310, 540, 22]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      text: 预处理与数据增强
  - elementId: preproc-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 342, 540, 112]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>· 统一缩放至 224 × 224，适配 ResNet 输入</p>
        <p>· 训练增强：随机水平翻转、±10° 旋转、亮度/对比度抖动</p>
        <p>· ImageNet 均值方差归一化，匹配预训练分布</p>
        <p>· 训练集再划出 10% 作为验证集（固定随机种子 42，验证集用固定预处理、不做随机增强）</p>
  # 右：数据统计表
  - elementId: data-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [640, 118, 260, 220]
    columnWidths: [0.4, 0.3, 0.3]
    rowHeights: [0.17, 0.166, 0.166, 0.166, 0.166, 0.166]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - text: "类别"
        - text: "训练"
        - text: "测试"
      - - text: "胶质瘤"
        - text: "1400"
        - text: "400"
      - - text: "脑膜瘤"
        - text: "1400"
        - text: "400"
      - - text: "无肿瘤"
        - text: "1400"
        - text: "400"
      - - text: "垂体瘤"
        - text: "1400"
        - text: "400"
      - - text: "合计"
          bold: true
        - text: "5600"
          bold: true
        - text: "1600"
          bold: true
  - elementId: table-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 346, 260, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 表 1　数据集类别分布（四类均衡）
  - elementId: data-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 372, 260, 44]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p>数据来源：<a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/masoudnickparvar/brain-tumor-mri-dataset">Kaggle — Brain Tumor MRI Dataset</a>（Nickparvar, 2021）</p>
  - elementId: data-audit
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 420, 260, 76]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 9
      text: |
        <p><strong>数据审计</strong>：训练/测试/外部三组间 MD5 精确重复 0 对；感知哈希疑似对经 16×16 哈希＋像素级复核均非真重复——排除跨组泄漏。按图像划分，患者独立性无法验证（公开数据无患者标识）。</p>
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 512, 400, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 9
      text: 脑肿瘤 MRI 图像分类辅助诊断系统 · 认知科学大作业
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 512, 40, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 9
      align: [right, top]
      text: "02"
